		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Luminous outline of a being. Fey spirit that claims a swath of wilderness as a demesne.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 54, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 touch +6 (1d10 + curse), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Curse</strong>. WIS 15+ or cursed, healing spells are DC 15 to cast on target.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Landscape</strong>. Mark a 10 mile radius of wilderness as demesne. Checks to track, navigate, hunt, forage, etc. are at DISADV. Travelers see hallucinations and visions.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
